# Prototype: laravel/Modules/* e laravel/Themes/*
# Canon: bashscripts/ai/wiki/rules/no-git-lfs.md
# Sync: bash bashscripts/templates/sync-gitattributes-modules.sh
#
# Git LFS vietato: i binari restano blob Git normali.

* text=auto
*.css linguist-vendored
*.scss linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
# Binary files (regular Git blobs, never Git LFS).
*.png binary !filter !merge !diff
*.jpg binary !filter !merge !diff
*.jpeg binary !filter !merge !diff
*.gif binary !filter !merge !diff
*.webp binary !filter !merge !diff
*.ico binary !filter !merge !diff
*.svg binary !filter !merge !diff
*.psd binary !filter !merge !diff
*.pdf binary !filter !merge !diff
*.zip binary !filter !merge !diff
*.woff binary !filter !merge !diff
*.woff2 binary !filter !merge !diff
*.ttf binary !filter !merge !diff
*.eot binary !filter !merge !diff
*.otf binary !filter !merge !diff
*.phar binary !filter !merge !diff
*.db binary !filter !merge !diff
*.sqlite binary !filter !merge !diff
